# Bad byte: U5 (bit 7 of main RAM) has its cell at $300 stuck at 1: the monitor works, but $0300 always reads with bit 7 set. The self-test shows 130080.
machine bw1
title "Bad byte"
brief "The BW-1 works, but one byte will not hold what is typed: AD 0300 DA 00 shows 0300 80, and DA 12 there shows 92."
fault cell U5.DOUT $300 1
